'''Iberian Soul''' is an organization-less [[:Category:Spain|Spanish]] ''[[Counter-Strike 2]]'' team. It was initially formed after [[KOI]] parted ways with their roster. Its second iteration was formed after [[Gentle Mates]] released their team.

==Timeline==
{{Tabs dynamic
|name1=2025
|name2=2026
|This=2
|content1=
*January 10th - '''Iberian Soul''' forms with a roster consisting of [[mopoz]], [[dav1g]], [[stadodo]], [[sausol]], and [[JUST]].  <ref name="Iberian Soul">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/officialstadodo/status/1877813656726974568|title=ANNOUCEMENT|date=2025-01-10|author=[[stadodo]]}}</ref>
*January 19th - '''Iberian Soul''' part ways with [[JUST]] and add [[alex (Spanish player)|alex]]. Additionally, [[slee]] joins as the manager. <ref name="-just; +alex">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/IberianSoul/status/1881018121592754660|title=Lineup oficial para esta season de #IberianSoul|trans_title=Official lineup for this season of #IberianSoul|language={{flag|es}} Spanish|date=2025-01-19|author='''Iberian Soul'''}}</ref>
*January 20th - '''Iberian Soul''' add [[repk3ys]] as coach. <ref name="+repk3ys">{{inside source|source=slee}}</ref>
*March 2nd - '''Iberian Soul''' add [[deLonge]] as coach and move [[repk3ys]] to an assistant coach position. <ref name="+deLonge">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/IberianSoul/status/1896211672676917560|title=COMUNICADO OFICIAL|trans_title=OFFICIAL STATEMENT|language={{Flag|es}} Spanish|date=2025-03-02|author='''Iberian Soul'''}}</ref>
*July 11th - '''Iberian Soul''' part ways with [[stadodo]]. <ref name="-stadodo">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/IberianSoul/status/1943760806874951896|title=Queremos comunicar que @officialstadodo no seguirá formando parte del proyecto de Iberian Soul|trans_title=We want to announce that @officialstadodo will no longer be part of the Iberian Soul project|language={{flag|es}} Spanish|date=2025-07-11|author='''Iberian Soul'''}}</ref>
*July 23rd - '''Iberian Soul''' add [[Martinez]]. <ref name="+martinez">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/IberianSoul/status/1948128360934085119|title=Parece que ya podemos anunciar a nuestro quinto!!|trans_title=It looks like we can now announce our fifth!!|language={{Flag|es}} Spanish|date=2025-07-23|author='''Iberian Soul'''}}</ref>
*August 25th - '''Iberian Soul''' is signed by [[Gentle Mates]]. <ref name="M8 Iberian Soul">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/gentlemates/status/1960006755905343677|title=GENTLE MATES ARRIVE SUR COUNTER-STRIKE 2 !|trans_title=GENTLE MATES IS COMING TO COUNTER-STRIKE 2!|language={{Flag|fr}} French|date=2025-08-25|author=[[Gentle Mates]]}}</ref>
|content2=
*August 7th - '''Iberian Soul''' reforms with a roster consisting of [[mopoz]], [[dav1g]], [[sausol]], [[alex (Spanish player)|alex]], [[djL]], and [[repk3ys]], the latter two as the team's coach and assistant coach, respectively. <ref name="iberian soul reform">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/45244/official-gentle-mates-leave-cs|title=Official:  Gentle Mates leave CS|date=2026-08-07|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[LucasAM]]}}</ref><ref name="djl">{{cite web|url=https://www.hltv.org/news/45247/alex-were-in-talks-with-some-orgs-but-this-is-affecting-us-mentally|title=alex: "We're in talks with some orgs, but is affecting us mentally"|date=2026-08-07|publisher=[[HLTV]]|author=[[LucasAM]]}}</ref>
}}

