'''Johnny Speeds''' is a [[:category:Sweden|Swedish]] esports organization founded in 2025 that was initially created as an organization-less team.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3

|content1=
* February 16th - '''Johnny Speeds''' forms with a roster consisting of [[draken (William Sundin)|draken]], [[Chawzyyy]], [[spooke]], [[Ro1f]], [[Lekr0]], and [[Chrille]] as the team's coach. <ref name="johnny speeds">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/drakenCSGO/status/1758453439325942049|title=Johnnyspeeds will be praccing & playing qualifiers, currently roster will be|date=2024-02-16|author=[[Draken_(William_Sundin)|draken]]}}</ref>
* July 1st - '''Johnny Speeds''' add [[bobeksde]] as [[Lekr0]] is signed by [[BC.Game Esports]]. <ref name="-lekr0">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/johnnyspeedscs/status/1807735060583367083|title=The news is correct|date=2024-06-30|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref>
* August 29th - [[Chawzyyy]] leaves '''Johnny Speeds'''. <ref name="-chawzyyy">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/johnnyspeedscs/status/1829176491663581292|title=Johnny Speeds and @chawzyyy have decided to go separate ways|date=2024-08-29|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref>
* September 12th - '''Johnny Speeds''' add [[hampus]]. <ref name="+hampus">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/johnnyspeedscs/status/1834247577690120363|title=WE WELCOME @hampuscsgo|date=2024-09-12|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref>
* December 8th - '''Johnny Speeds''' remove [[hampus]]. <ref name="-hampus">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/hampuscsgo/status/1865762071947739200|title=My loan to Johhny Speeds ended and, as my previous teammates in bleed im able to look for new opportunities at any region|date=2024-12-08|author=[[hampus]]}}</ref>

|content2=
* January 4th - [[spooke]] is signed by [[OG]]. <ref name="-spooke">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/OGcsgo/status/1875563575944867960|title=A warm welcome to @spookecs|date=2025-01-04|author=[[OG]]}}</ref>
* January 13th - [[bobeksde]] is signed by [[9INE]]. <ref name="-bobeksde">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/9inegg/status/1878864711212794321|title=We're happy to announce our roster for the 2025 season|date=2025-01-13|author=[[9INE]]}}</ref>
* February 4th - '''Johnny Speeds''' sign [[SHiNE]] and [[Sapec]]. <ref name="+shine">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/JohnnySpeedsCS/status/1886800936711979443|title=Johnny Speeds are HERE. TO. STAY.|date=2025-02-04|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref>
