* April 23rd - '''Johnny Speeds''' bench [[Ro1f]] and sign [[Svedjehed]] as his replacement. <ref name="+svedjehed">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/JohnnySpeedsCS/status/1915076994082955667|title=You've already seen him in action the past few days|date=2025-04-23|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref>
* April 29th - '''Johnny Speeds''' sign [[Hype]] as an assistant coach and analyst and release [[Ro1f]]. <ref name="+hype">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/JohnnySpeedsCS/status/1917286113196036288|title=Figured it's a great time to make an announcement|date=2025-04-29|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref><ref name="-ro1f">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/JohnnySpeedsCS/status/1917172139473449473|title=Ro1f Released from Contract, Becoming a Free Agent|date=2025-04-29|author='''Johnny Speeds'''}}</ref>
